{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o046a","title":"张飞瓦口破张郃","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o046a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"夏侯渊、张郃屯汉中侵巴，刘备使张飞进宕渠，在瓦口破张郃，张郃退南郑，刘备还成都。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-e-o031c-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张郃进宕渠为张飞所拒还南郑迁将军","evidence":["zhangle-e-o031c-q"]},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o018b-account","label":"《关张马黄赵传第六》正文","text":"张飞宕渠拒破张郃张郃退南郑","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o018b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0278","role":"屯汉中","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"败退","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0367","role":"破敌","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"遣将","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"宕渠瓦口、南郑","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"]},"time":{"label":"曹操定汉中后","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o046a-q"],"after":"wudi-e-o176b"},"source_order":[32,202,"O046a"],"order":3551},{"id":"wudi-e-o176b","title":"曹军夜袭破阳平","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o176b-account","label":"正文","text":"守军因曹军退却而解备，曹操遣军夜袭，大破敌军斩杨任，张卫夜遁，张鲁奔巴中。","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o045a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备闻曹操平汉中、张鲁走巴西。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o045a-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-57f65101b824182cc18b","label":"正文","text":"鲁欲降弟卫不肯率众拒关坚守太祖攻破之","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-6bab1ba78435eeef70cc"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-8534c138c46cb90670ab","label":"正文","text":"鲁闻阳平陷圃劝依杜濩朴胡奔南山入巴中","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-eb4b99ce42320de9875e","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"董昭表言武帝征鲁阳平之险幸而克","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-f4ff8b89230da169b39e","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"杨暨表言征鲁对兵三日欲还鲁守自坏","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-7fc2c40720129e9ed48e"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-7b78046bf6dc265d243a","label":"裴注·世语","text":"野麋突坏卫营高祚等夜会众卫惧遂降","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-2aea4a3865cb2c2daf3c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣兵夜袭","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0346","role":"夜袭","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0347","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0344","role":"逃走","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0279","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0036","role":"又曰今以迫往功必轻不如依杜濩赴朴胡相拒然后委质功必多","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0349","role":"被劝所依者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0348","role":"被劝所赴者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0122","role":"表曰武皇帝承凉州从事及武都降人之辞说张鲁易攻信以为然、及往临履不如所闻乃叹曰他人商度少如人意","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"故大将军、受遣呼山上兵还、前自见乃还白武皇帝","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0015","role":"将军、同受遣呼山上兵还","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"侍中、在兵后语惇褚言官兵已据得贼要屯贼已散走","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"wendi-p0071","role":"侍中、同语惇褚","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0055","role":"表曰武皇帝始征张鲁以十万之众身亲临履指授方略因就民麦以为军粮","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-7fc2c40720129e9ed48e"]}],"place":{"text":"阳平、巴中","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二十年秋七月","year":215,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q","wudi-q-o173","wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab"],"chronology":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"建安二十年秋七月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,998,"O176b"],"order":374}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0183","name":"张郃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0278","name":"夏侯渊","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0367","name":"张飞","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o018b-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-06e52a7e537d6c70eb74","layer":"original","quote":"曹公破张鲁，留夏侯渊、张郃守汉川。郃别督诸军下巴西，欲徙其民于汉中；进军宕渠蒙头、荡石〖8〗，与飞相拒五十余日。飞率精卒万余人，从他道邀郃军交战：山道迮狭〖9〗，前后不得相救，飞遂破郃；郃弃马缘山，独与麾下十余人从间道退〖10〗，引军还南郑。巴土获安。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":8,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o046a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-9a48917c3ff4511578df","layer":"original","quote":"曹公使夏侯渊、张郃屯汉中，数数犯暴巴界〖6〗。先主令张飞进兵宕渠〖7〗，与郃等战于瓦口〖8〗；破郃等， 〔郃〕 收兵还南郑〖9〗。先主亦还成都。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o031c-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-9660463527d31e82b011","layer":"original","quote":"进军宕渠〖8〗，为备将张飞所拒，引还南郑。拜荡寇将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":101,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
